[2]: https://github.com/lxqt/pcmanfm-qt/wiki/custom_actions?utm_source=chatgpt.com "custom_actions · lxqt/pcmanfm-qt Wiki · GitHub"
[3]: https://github.com/lxqt/pcmanfm-qt?utm_source=chatgpt.com "GitHub - lxqt/pcmanfm-qt: File manager and desktop icon manager (Qt port of PCManFM and libfm) · GitHub"
